{"id":50112,"date":"2026-03-25T13:57:20","date_gmt":"2026-03-25T12:57:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50112"},"modified":"2026-08-19T10:43:36","modified_gmt":"2026-08-19T09:43:36","slug":"legua-diario-de-coimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/legua-diario-de-coimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO L\u00c9GUA DI\u00c1RIO DE COIMBRA -->\n\n<!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026<\/span>\n  <\/h2>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A 27.\u00aa L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra convida-o a percorrer as art\u00e9rias emblem\u00e1ticas do centro hist\u00f3rico, com data oficial marcada para 5 de outubro de 2026. Com 5 km de dist\u00e2ncia em asfalto citadino, o tra\u00e7ado exige uma leitura atenta do piso face \u00e0s exigentes varia\u00e7\u00f5es de inclina\u00e7\u00e3o que unem a Baixa e a Alta da cidade. A ader\u00eancia firme do pavimento urbano permite fluir e impor ritmo nas avenidas e sec\u00e7\u00f5es planas, mas a conquista das rampas e o constante sobe e desce requerem uma excelente gest\u00e3o do terreno.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">\/ Snapshot<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong> <span>5 de outubro de 2026<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong> <span>Coimbra (Partida: Rua da Sofia \/ Chegada: Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio)<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span>5 km (Corrida e Caminhada)<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n    <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n      <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong> <span>Asfalto (Urbano)<\/span>\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Prova &#038; Percurso<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    O percurso da L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra desenrola-se inteiramente em piso duro, combinando zonas r\u00e1pidas com rampas urbanas. A transi\u00e7\u00e3o entre a Baixa e a Alta imp\u00f5e um desafio cont\u00ednuo ao n\u00edvel da altimetria, com sec\u00e7\u00f5es em que a inclina\u00e7\u00e3o se acentua fortemente, testando a progress\u00e3o cont\u00ednua no asfalto e a estabilidade nas descidas.\n  <\/p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A exposi\u00e7\u00e3o solar e a pr\u00f3pria disposi\u00e7\u00e3o do casario requerem aten\u00e7\u00e3o especial nas curvas mais fechadas do percurso hist\u00f3rico. Em contraste, as sec\u00e7\u00f5es a descer e as ruas mais largas oferecem excelente tra\u00e7\u00e3o e a oportunidade ideal para tirar partido do embalo do relevo, conduzindo num esfor\u00e7o final at\u00e9 \u00e0 pra\u00e7a principal.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 4. BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE (CTA INTERATIVO FIXO) -->\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner {\n    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important;\n    border-radius: 16px !important;\n    padding: 18px 22px !important;\n    margin: 24px 0 !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: space-between !important;\n    flex-wrap: wrap !important;\n    gap: 14px !important;\n    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-header {\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n    margin-bottom: 4px !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-title {\n    color: #FFFFFF !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc {\n    color: #94A3B8 !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn {\n    display: inline-flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    gap: 8px !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important;\n    color: #C4B5FD !important;\n    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    padding: 10px 20px !important;\n    border-radius: 20px !important;\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"pr-calc-event-header\">\n      <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span>\n      <span class=\"pr-calc-event-title\">Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <span class=\"pr-calc-event-desc\">Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span>\n  <\/div>\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" class=\"pr-calc-event-btn\">\n    Calculadora de Pace \u2192\n  <\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 5. ONDE FICAR \/ ALOJAMENTO -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar em Coimbra (Alojamento)<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Para facilitar a desloca\u00e7\u00e3o no dia da prova, recomendamos estas zonas:\n  <\/p>\n  <ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Baixa de Coimbra:<\/strong> Ideal para estar a poucos passos da linha de partida na Rua da Sofia e da meta na Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio, facilitando toda a log\u00edstica de chegada e partida sem necessidade de usar transporte.<\/li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Zona da Alta \/ Universidade:<\/strong> Oferece excelentes op\u00e7\u00f5es de alojamento com vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre a cidade e o rio Mondego, embora exija descer at\u00e9 \u00e0 Baixa no in\u00edcio do evento e voltar a subir ap\u00f3s o seu t\u00e9rmino.<\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA E SOBRE O LOCAL -->\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Coimbra, banhada pelo rio Mondego e mundialmente famosa pela sua imponente e hist\u00f3rica Universidade, \u00e9 uma cidade onde a academia e as tradi\u00e7\u00f5es se cruzam em cada viela. Ap\u00f3s dominar o sobe e desce da prova, a sugest\u00e3o recai sobre um prato substancial e reparador da regi\u00e3o: a Chanfana, tradicionalmente assada no forno a lenha com vinho tinto, acompanhada por batata cozida para uma reposi\u00e7\u00e3o eficaz de energias.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- 7. SEC\u00c7\u00c3O DE FAQS (DESIGN SYSTEM HOMEPAGE) -->\n<section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span>\n  <\/h3>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a L\u00e9gua Di\u00e1rio de Coimbra 2026.<\/p>\n\n  <div class=\"pr-faq-grid\">\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Os resultados e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o, que pode ser acedida na sec\u00e7\u00e3o de links abaixo.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>As fotografias do evento s\u00e3o geralmente publicadas nas redes sociais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o ou em plataformas especializadas de fotografia desportiva nos dias seguintes \u00e0 prova.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n\n    <details class=\"pr-faq-item\">\n      <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\">O percurso de 2026 tem novidades face aos anos anteriores?<\/summary>\n      <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\">\n        <p>Sim, a 27.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o conta com um tra\u00e7ado renovado e exigente pelo centro hist\u00f3rico, com a partida instalada na Rua da Sofia e a meta na emblem\u00e1tica Pra\u00e7a 8 de Maio.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/details>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL -->\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50113,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50112","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-coimbra","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/banner-legua-diario-coimbra-2026-min.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50112","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50112"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50112\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":60510,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50112\/revisions\/60510"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/50113"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=50112"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=50112"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=50112"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=50112"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=50112"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=50112"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=50112"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}